ied.. Compact wiring/layout resources for robotics and automation. Generic devices expose functional conductor terminals rather than commercial package/cable pinouts; the three named Pololu carriers retain source-checked component-side header order. Hose ports represent complete pneumatic connections; cable ports represent complete interfaces. Mechanical shafts/mounts are artwork, not electrical points. No SPICE, firmware, motion simulation, internal netlist connections or implied ratings.</DESCRIPTION><PPP>1</PPP><REF_POINT pos="46,46" power="false" part="1"/><TinyCAD><RECTANGLE a="0,0" b="46,38" style="5" fill="8"/><RECTANGLE a="2,2" b="44,20" style="5" fill="9"/><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="4,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="7,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="10,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="13,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="16,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="19,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="22,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="25,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="28,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="31,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><POLYGON polygon="0" style="6" pos="34,3" fill="0"><POINT pos="0,0" arc="0"/><POINT pos="0,15" arc="0"/></POLYGON><RECTANGLE a="33,5" b="41,13" style="5" fill="10"/><NOTE_TEXT a="33.4,8.2"